      "onFilter": "Choosing a chip shuffles the pile and re-scatters only the matching photos. All brings everyone back."
    },
    "moreButton": {
      "label": "See older gatherings",
      "variant": "secondary"
    },
    "designNotes": [
      "Choosing a chip shuffles the pile and re-scatters only the matching photos. All brings everyone back.",
      "The photo straightens to 0°, lifts 8px, and its shadow grows. The card on the left shows this state.",
      "Each photo gets a small tilt (between -4° and +4°), an offset, and one of three sizes. Overlaps are intentional, like photos on a table.",
      "Photos are Pexels stand-ins (backs, hands, and wide shots only). Titles, dates, captions, and notes are drafts marked CHECK."
    ]
